{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>בפתח עינים אשר</b> ס\"ת רמ\"ח, like the numerical value of אברהם, for she said: May it be His will that I draw seed from Abraham." "<b>כי גדל</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the others: עד כי גדל מאד, כי גדל הכאב מאד. Because she saw that כי גדל — her greatness, grew — the כאב (pain) of her כי גדל; and in this merit, there emerged from her the kingdom of the House of David, which went and grew עד כי גדל מאד."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {0 "ס\"ת (sum of final letters) yields 248; the verse phrases 'she said' is inferred from Tamar's implicit intention."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:59.469252154Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}